    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20779" root="سمل" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَمَّالٌ</span></b>  [<i>One who puts out the eyes of others</i>].
A certain tribe were called <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَنُو السَّمَّالِ</span>, (M, K, *)
or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَنُو سَمَّالٍ</span>, (S, TA,) because their founder had
put out the eye of a man. (S, M, K.)

